WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:03.903
&gt;&gt;&gt; AS THE WORLD WAITS FOR
PUTIN'S NEXT MOVE, IT'S HIS

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:07.240
CONTINUED THREAT OF NUCLEAR WAR
THAT HAS PRESIDENT BIDEN

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:09.909
DOUBLING DOWN ON A CHILLING
WARNING IN AN EXCLUSIVE

00:00:09.909 --> 00:00:15.515
INTERVIEW WITH CNN.
&gt;&gt; HE, IN FACT, CANNOT CONTINUE

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:20.286
WITH IMPUNITY TO TALK ABOUT THE
USE OF A TACTICAL NUCLEAR WEAPON

00:00:20.286 --> 00:00:22.288
AS IF IT'S A RATIONAL THING TO
DO.

00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:26.793
THE MISTAKES GET MADE.
AND THE MISCALCULATION COULD

00:00:26.793 --> 00:00:28.428
OCCUR.
NO ONE CAN BE SURE WHAT WOULD

00:00:28.428 --> 00:00:31.231
HAPPEN AND IT COULD END IN
ARMAGEDDON.

00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:34.267
&gt;&gt; BUT THE PRESIDENT ALSO
STRESSED HE STILL DOESN'T THINK

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:38.171
PUTIN WILL ACTUALLY RESORT TO
NUKES DESPITE HIS LOSSES AND

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:44.010
DESPERATION.
CNN'S KAITLAN COLLINS IS AT THE

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:46.112
WHITE HOUSE WITH MORE.
A CAREFULLY WORDED MESSAGE FROM

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:47.814
THE PRESIDENT.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: HE SEEMS TO BE, YOU

00:00:47.814 --> 00:00:50.850
KNOW, REALLY CLARIFYING WHAT HE
WAS SAYING IN THAT CLOSED DOOR

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:53.719
FUND-RAISER LAST WEEK WHEN HE
FIRST WAS TALKING ABOUT THE IDEA

00:00:53.719 --> 00:00:55.822
OF ARMAGEDDON HERE AND SAYING
THAT HE BELIEVES BASICALLY THE

00:00:55.822 --> 00:00:59.759
WORLD IS ON THE CLOSEST BRINK OF
NUCLEAR WAR THAT IT HAS BEEN

00:00:59.759 --> 00:01:02.962
SINCE THE 1960s WHEN THE CUBAN
MISSILE CRISIS HAPPENED TRYING

00:01:02.962 --> 00:01:05.198
TO CLARIFY WHAT HE WAS SAYING
THERE AND ALSO TALKING ABOUT

00:01:05.198 --> 00:01:08.668
WHAT HE THINKS ABOUT PUTIN
OVERALL, SAYING HE DOES BELIEVE

00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:11.470
HE IS STILL A RATIONAL ACTOR,
THAT DESPITE WHAT YOU'VE HEARD

00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:14.507
FROM SOME OTHER WORLD LEADERS
AND INTELLIGENCE EXPERTS AND

00:01:14.507 --> 00:01:17.210
WHAT THEY'VE SPECULATED ABOUT
PUTIN'S MINDSET HERE BUT WHAT

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:20.113
PRESIDENT BIDEN SAID TO JAKE
TAPPER WAS HE DOES BELIEVE HE IS

00:01:20.113 --> 00:01:22.882
A RATIONAL ACTOR WHO MADE A
DECISION THAT WAS NOT RATIONAL

00:01:22.882 --> 00:01:25.685
BY SENDING HIS TROOPS INTO
UKRAINE, HE SAYS HE BELIEVES HE

00:01:25.685 --> 00:01:28.588
BASICALLY MISJUDGED THE
SITUATION AND THOUGHT WHAT HE

00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:31.558
WAS GOING INTO WAS GOING TO LOOK
A LOT DIFFERENT THAN IT DOES.

00:01:31.558 --> 00:01:42.101
HERE'S WHAT HE TOLD JAKE TAPPER.
&gt;&gt; I THINK HE IS A RATIONAL

00:01:42.101 --> 00:01:47.840
ACTOR THAT MISCALCULATED.
HE THOUGHT THIS IS THE HOME OF

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:52.278
RUSSIA AND I THINK HE TOTALLY
MISCALCULATED.

00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:54.914
&gt;&gt; Reporter: TODAY HE WAS
LEAVING THE INTERVIEW AND SAID

00:01:54.914 --> 00:01:58.418
HE BELIEVES THE LATEST RUSSIAN
ATTACKS ON CIVILIAN TARGETS ARE

00:01:58.418 --> 00:02:01.821
BRUTAL, THAT THEY ARE BEYOND THE
PALE AND ASKED ABOUT A COMMENT

00:02:01.821 --> 00:02:04.791
HE MADE YESTERDAY WHERE HE SAID
HE DOESN'T SEE HIMSELF SITTING

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:08.328
DOWN TO MEET WITH PUTIN BUT
OVERALL IF THERE IS A SITUATION

00:02:08.328 --> 00:02:12.265
LIKE AT THE G20 SUMMIT WITH
WORLD LEADERS GATHERING IN BALI

00:02:12.265 --> 00:02:16.269
IN NOVEMBER AND IT WAS TO TALK
ABOUT BRITTNEY GRINER OR ONE OF

00:02:16.269 --> 00:02:19.973
THE DETAINED MIAMERICANS, THAT
SOMETHING HE COULD SEE FEASIBLE.

00:02:19.973 --> 00:02:22.675
ANY MOVEMENT IN THAT SPACE, HE
SAID, QUOTE, NOT WITH PUTIN.

00:02:22.808 --> 00:02:25.445
TALKED ABOUT THIS IN HIS
INTERVIEW WITH JAKE TAPPER LAST

00:02:25.445 --> 00:02:28.381
NIGHT WHERE HE SAYS HE BELIEVES
PUTIN IS RATIONAL.

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:32.719
HOWEVER, HE SAYS PUTIN NEEDS TO
CHANGE HIS BEHAVIOR.

00:02:32.719 --> 00:02:38.958
NO RATIONAL LEADER WOULD DO
THIS.

00:02:38.958 --> 00:02:43.763
&gt;&gt; HOW REALISTIC DO YOU THINK IT
IS PUTIN WOULD USE A NUCLEAR

00:02:43.763 --> 00:02:45.465
TACTICAL WEAPON.
&gt;&gt; I DON'T THINK HE WILL BUT

00:02:45.465 --> 00:02:47.367
IT'S IRRESPONSIBLE TO TALK ABOUT
IT.

00:02:47.367 --> 00:02:51.104
THE IDEA THAT A WORLD LEADER
SAYS HE MAY USE A TACTICAL

00:02:51.104 --> 00:02:55.875
NUCLEAR WEAPON IN UKRAINE, HE,
IN FACT, CANNOT CONTINUE WITH

00:02:55.875 --> 00:03:00.280
IMPUNITY TO TALK ABOUT THE USE
OF A TACKTY TALL NUCLEAR WEAPON

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:02.415
AS IF IT'S A RATIONAL THING TO
DO.

00:03:02.415 --> 00:03:06.552
THE MISTAKES GET MADE AND THE
MISCALCULATION COULD OCCUR, NO

00:03:06.552 --> 00:03:08.788
ONE CAN BE SURE WHAT WOULD
HAPPEN AND IT COULD END IN

00:03:08.788 --> 00:03:12.625
ARMAGEDDON.
&gt;&gt; THE ARMAGEDDON LINE HE USED

00:03:12.625 --> 00:03:17.230
AT A FUND-RAISER IN PRIVATE.
PUTIN NEEDS TO STOP THIS BECAUSE

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:21.734
SOMEBODY MIGHT SEE SOME ACTION,
MISINTERPRET WHAT IT IS AND MAKE

00:03:21.734 --> 00:03:25.004
A MISTAKE EVEN IF PUTIN ISN'T
GOING TO USE A TACTICAL NUCLEAR

00:03:25.004 --> 00:03:27.040
WEAPON.
YOU DON'T TALK ABOUT IT BECAUSE

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:29.876
IT GETS EVERYBODY ON EDGE.
&gt;&gt; THAT'S BIDEN WHEN HE WAS

00:03:29.876 --> 00:03:32.779
ASKED ABOUT OR WHEN HIS AIDE WAS
ASKED ABOUT THE ARMAGEDDON

00:03:32.779 --> 00:03:34.847
COMMENT AFTER HE MADE IT
INITIALLY, THIS IS THE PRESIDENT

00:03:34.847 --> 00:03:38.584
TRYING TO BE VERY REALISTIC AND
VERY STARK ABOUT WHAT THE STAKES

00:03:38.584 --> 00:03:41.520
ARE, YOU KNOW, THE INTELLIGENCE
OFFICIALS HAVE SAID THERE'S NO

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:45.091
CHANGE TO THE NUCLEAR POSTURE.
THEY DON'T EXPECT ANYTHING

00:03:45.091 --> 00:03:50.163
IMMINENT ANY TIME SOON BUT HE'S
BEING VERY CLEAR SAYING THAT

00:03:50.163 --> 00:03:53.399
THIS COULD BE -- WE COULD BE
HEADED BACK TO 1962 AND THIS

00:03:53.399 --> 00:03:55.768
COULD BE THE GREATEST CHALLENGE
SINCE THEN.

00:03:55.768 --> 00:03:58.338
THAT'S THE POINT HE GETS ACROSS.
I THINK THERE HAVE BEEN OTHER

00:03:58.338 --> 00:04:03.142
TIMES DURING THE CRISIS, DURING
THIS WAR WHERE HE HAS BEEN MUCH

00:04:03.142 --> 00:04:07.146
MORE AGGRESSIVE IN HIS RHETORIC
BUT HE IS CERTAINLY STANDING BY

00:04:07.146 --> 00:04:10.183
IT NOW BECAUSE THIS IS WHAT HE
WANTS TO CONVEY TO THE AMERICAN

00:04:10.183 --> 00:04:12.752
PUBLIC ABOUT WHAT COULD HAPPEN
IF SOMETHING GOES HORRIBLY

00:04:12.752 --> 00:04:13.820
WRONG.
&gt;&gt; BOTH PRESIDENTS ARE EXPECTED

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:20.760
TO BE AT THE G20 COMING UP.
THAT WOULD BE A CHANCE GIVEN A

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:23.262
DICEY POLITICS TO MAKE THAT CASE
WITH PUTIN.

00:04:23.262 --> 00:04:26.399
THE PRESIDENT SAYS I DON'T THINK
SO UNLESS --

00:04:26.399 --> 00:04:29.302
&gt;&gt; LOOK, I HAVE NO INTENTION OF
MEETING WITH HIM, BUT, FOR

00:04:29.302 --> 00:04:32.672
EXAMPLE, IF HE CAME TO ME AT THE
G20 AND SAID I WANT TO TALK

00:04:32.672 --> 00:04:35.408
ABOUT THE RELEASE OF GRINER, I'D
MEET WITH HIM.

00:04:35.408 --> 00:04:39.412
I MEAN, IT WOULD DEPEND BUT I
CAN'T IMAGINE -- HE'S COMMITTED

00:04:39.412 --> 00:04:44.884
WAR CRIMES AND SO I DON'T -- I
DON'T SEE ANY RATIONAL TO MEET

00:04:44.884 --> 00:04:47.353
WITH HIM NOW.
&gt;&gt; A COUPLE INTERESTING POINTS

00:04:47.353 --> 00:04:49.422
THERE.
ONE REPEATING AGAIN THAT PUTIN

00:04:49.422 --> 00:04:54.660
HAS COMMITTED WAR CRIMES, TWO,
ALSO SAYING THAT THERE IS

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:57.430
OPENNESS TO MEETING WITH HIM BUT
ON AN ISSUE THAT DIRECTLY

00:04:57.430 --> 00:05:01.000
INVOLVES THE U.S. AND RUSSIA,
THAT BEING THE DETAINMENT OF

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:04.437
BRITTNEY GRINER THEN WENT ON TO
SAY AS WELL THAT, LOOK, OUR

00:05:04.437 --> 00:05:08.441
FOCUS RIGHT NOW IS WHEN IT COMES
TO THE INVASION OF UKRAINE

00:05:08.441 --> 00:05:12.912
INVOLVING UKRAINE IN ANY TALKS
WITH PUTIN OR ANYONE ELSE.

00:05:12.912 --> 00:05:16.015
HE EMPFA SIZED THAT AS WELL BUT
THE BRITTNEY GRINER ISSUE, THAT

00:05:16.015 --> 00:05:18.818
IS INTERESTING AS OBVIOUSLY THE
WHITE HOUSE HAS BEEN FACING

00:05:18.818 --> 00:05:22.655
PRESSURE AS WELL AT TIMES TO
MESSAGE MORE ABOUT THIS, TO TALK

00:05:22.655 --> 00:05:26.192
MORE ABOUT THIS AS WELL AND TO
TAKE SOME ACTION ON HER RELEASE.

